      "title": "A mean is not the data",
      "prompt": "A paper reports only that the mean of ten heights is 170 cm. How many recorded heights are in that sentence?",
      "answer": "None. The sentence reports a summary. The ten heights are the data, and they are not shown."
    }
  ],
  "dataset": [
    {
      "title": "Relative frequency after a deletion",
      "prompt": "The dataset of household sizes is 2, 4, 3, 2, 5. The household of size 5 is removed. What is the relative frequency of the value 2?",
