    {
      "title": "A code is not a mean of the category",
      "prompt": "Pain is coded 1, 2, 3 for none, mild, and severe. The codes of three patients are 1, 3, and 2. Why is the average 2 not a pain?",
      "answer": "The codes name ordered categories. Their average is an average of codes, not a pain on that scale."
    }
  ],
  "levels-of-measurement": [
