      "title": "A sample that does not change",
      "prompt": "In that same population, a sample of the two smallest outputs, 10 and 12, is kept after the sixth workshop is added. What is the sample mean?",
      "answer": "The sample mean stays (10+12)/2 = 11."
    }
  ],
  "sample": [
